{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/line2.png?t=1753438316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/oyf.png?t=1753438316\" /></div><strong><i>Overcome Your Fears</i> - </strong>is a psychological atmospheric horror game that immerses you in a world of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game you are exploring the story of 19-year-old Steve Jackson, who takes a job house-sitting for friends while they are on vacation. What starts as a simple favor quickly turns into a chilling experience as unsettling events unfold in the quiet town. Little does Steve know, that these days will reveal dark secrets, and he must make choices that will change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/line2.png?t=1753438316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game primarily features a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/forgif__1_.gif?t=1753438316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/line2.png?t=1753438316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological horror elements with unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive dialogues with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player voice activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique sound effects that create tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/line2.png?t=1753438316\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550490?t=1753438316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/1078dcc3bcd706dbfa74a7a04e8035791da76163/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753438316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/810f3f5c0d519308930dd57060d5b5394f2bd1b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753438316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/810f3f5c0d519308930dd57060d5b5394f2bd1b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753438316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/line2.png?t=1753438316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/oyf.png?t=1753438316\" /></div><strong><i>Overcome Your Fears</i> - </strong>is a psychological atmospheric horror game that immerses you in a world of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game you are exploring the story of 19-ye